  "//levels": "The field is a function of `level`. `curLvl` records what is built; when it differs from `level`, `rebuild` goes high and every entity takes its setup branch. Death sets curLvl to -1, rebuilding the same level. `respawn` moves only the ball, and only on death or startup - clearing a level reconfigures the field around a ball that keeps its momentum."
}
